{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22885","headline":"早发楚城驿 · 白居易","name":"早发楚城驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨过尘埃灭，沿江道径平。\n月乘残夜出，人趁早凉行。\n寂历闲吟动，冥蒙暗思生。\n荷塘飜露气，稻垄泻泉声。\n宿犬闻铃起，栖禽见火惊。\n曨曨烟树色，十里始天明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}